  "_comment": "Authored by design (not generated). Layer names are matched by prefix. 'within' is the box a slot's block must stay inside, keeping the same margin it has in the design (mirror). Values can be per format. 'scaleGroup': every text in that layer scales together with the slot (headline reads as one unit). 'inset' sets the margin explicitly. 'variants.<name>.slots' overrides slot rules for that variant. 'designs.<design>' replaces the slot rules it names (and 'containers' when given) for that design: each design has its own layers. Themes only recolour, so they share the design's rules.",
